# Parser self-verification control [SELFCHECK:CTRL-DOC]

> Ground truth for this corpus lives in the SIDECAR `control.expected.json`, never in
> this file. A parser broken enough to misread this corpus would misread an oracle
> embedded in it, and the check would then agree with itself.

---

## [CASE-P1-SIMPLE] P1 simple property form

- status: active
- owner: selfcheck

## [CASE-P2-BOLD] P2 bold-key property form

- **audience**: architect

## [CASE-P3-MULTI] P3 multi-value property form over a REL_PROPERTY_EDGES key

- see-also: [CASE-P1-SIMPLE], [CASE-P2-BOLD]

## [CASE-P4-NESTED] P4 nested-list property form

- depends-on:
  - [CASE-P1-SIMPLE]
  - [CASE-P3-MULTI]

## [CASE-P5-MAPPING] P5 YAML-mapping property form

- provenance:
  authored_by: selfcheck
