## [CASE-CONFIDENCE] SPEC 7.1 confidence mapping

- confidence:
  value: 0.85
  blast_radius: high
  rationale: measured against silent-loss-classes v4
  assessed_by: ui-architect
  assessed_at: 2025-06-02T00:00:00Z

## [CASE-CONTEXT-FOR-CHANGE] SPEC 8.1 mapping with a KEYED invalidating_assumption

- change: the parser gained the P5 mapping form
- context_for_change:
  prior_state: a mapping under a key-only head collected nothing
  reasoning: SPEC 8.1 specifies the primitive AS a YAML mapping
  rejected_alternative: reading the indented block as a list of strings
  counter_argument: a list would preserve every character the author wrote
  counter_response: a list is not queryable by sub-field, which is the whole point
  invalidating_assumption: that SPEC 2.2's four enumerated forms are exhaustive
  implication: sub-fields become first-class queryable fields

## [CASE-FLOW-DECISION] Flow decision step with labelled branches

- condition: did the indented block parse?
- actor: lts-engine
- if-true: [CASE-FLOW-PASS]
- if-false: [CASE-FLOW-FAIL]

## [CASE-FLOW-PASS] Flow step reached when the block parsed

- next-step: [CASE-FLOW-DONE]

## [CASE-FLOW-FAIL] Flow step reached when the block did not parse

- next-step: [CASE-FLOW-DONE]

## [CASE-FLOW-DONE] Flow terminal step

- status: terminal

