## Relationships

### Semantic

- [CASE-REL-BULLETED] DEPENDS_ON [CASE-P1-SIMPLE]
  reasoning: an indented unbulleted continuation line in this section
  prior_state: it must never be read as a property of anything
  - an indented bulleted continuation line must not be either
- note: a column-0 annotation bullet here is prose, not a near miss
[CASE-REL-UNBULLETED] IMPLEMENTS [CASE-P2-BOLD]

