## [CASE-CANONICAL] SL-38 `canonical-node` -- a legacy node pointing at its canonical node (NOT supersession)

- canonical-node: [CASE-P1-SIMPLE]

## [CASE-CANONICAL-BARE] SL-38b bare `canonical` is free-text status prose and must mint NOTHING

