## [CASE-REV-PROC] SL-39 attaches-to-hook and applies-rule -- one review PROC step

- attaches-to-hook: [CASE-REV-HOOK]
- applies-rule: [CASE-REV-RULE]
- order: 1

## [CASE-REV-RULE] SL-39 applies-rule -- a review rule POINTING at an existing rule node

